WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Portugal is located on the western tip of the Iberian Peninsula along the Atlantic Ocean.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Mount Pico in the Azores archipelago rises to 2,351 meters as Portugal's highest summit.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
In Lisbon, the 16th-century Belém Tower stands on the Tagus River as a symbol of the Age of Discovery.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Melancholic Fado music is sung with passionate poetry accompanied by the 12-string Portuguese guitar.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Celebrated culinary treats include creamy Pastéis de Nata custard tarts dusted with cinnamon.

